<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="HEB" style="id">Vidunda Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc1">Baluwa kwa Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc2">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="toc3">Waeb</para>
  <para style="mt2">Baluwa kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Waebulaniya</para>
  <para style="imt">Chilongole</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha Waebulaniya ndo baluwa ilinguwakangaza nhumbula kwa vila yangulajila vila Yesu vyoyatawize uloli wa Ilagano lya Katali. Baluwa ayi nayandichigwa kota usenga wa mdamla. Mgati mwa baluwa ya Waebulaniya kuna mzidi wa vinhu vya kukumbuka vifichile makumi sita (60) kulawa kuli Ilagano lya Katali vilingulajila ne ufiso vila Yesu vyoyatawize uloli na mijito ja Mtambika Mkulu. Kwa chiwalo achi, chitabu achi chiwa cha kuwakangaza nhumbula Wayahudi walingumkunda Kilistu. Baluwa kwa Waebulaniya yangulajila ndaze Yesu vyoyatawize malajizo Nguluwi yampele Musa leka kuwadita watambika waleche kulavya nhambiko kahi. Yesu ndo nhambiko kwa gehile geng'ha, mhela weng'ha woyabagame. Wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu kuli mhela awu wa sambi, wochifika wochikangaza nhumbula kuli baluwa kwa Waebulaniya kwa kulutilila kumuwinza Yesu Kilistu kwa vila ndo yumwe yatuditile hetwe tweng'ha tumkunde Nguluwi na kahi kulutilila kumkunda heye (Waebulaniya 12:2).</para>
  <para style="ip">Kuduhu ne yumwe yamzelele yalihi yandiche baluwa kwa Waebulaniya, ila wasomile wangijesa hanji nayandichigwa na Mtumigwa Paoli na Lukasi ama Banaba. Mhela woyandichigwe hauzeleche, ila yangujesigwa kota nayandichigwa kuli mwaka wa makumi saba (70) haunafika hala Yesu loyavumbuche. Muji wa Yelusalemu nauwifigwa kuli mwaka wa makumi saba (70) loyavumbuche Yesu Kilistu, ila yandiche baluwa ayi kangulonga mbuli ya muji wa Yelusalemu nawali ung'hali haunawifigwa. Baluwa ya Waebulaniya nayandichigwa kuli muji wa Loma (Waebulaniya 13:24) nailechigwa leka isomigwe kuli vilundo vinji vya wanhu walingumkunda Kilistu.</para>
  <para style="iot">Gali mgati</para>
  <para style="io">1. Yandiche kangulajila kota Yesu ndo yawele mkulu kwa waloli na wahilisi wa Nguluwi (Waebulaniya 1:1-4:13).</para>
  <para style="io">2. Kahi kangulutilila kulajila kota Yesu ndo mkulu kwa watambika walingukola mijito kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi ako Yelusalemu (Waebulaniya 4:14-7:28).</para>
  <para style="io">3. Kahi mijito ya Yesu ndo ng'hulu kusinda Ilagano lya Katali Nguluwi lyoyawichile kwa wanhu wa heye kukolela Malajizo yampele Musa (Waebulaniya 8:1-10:31).</para>
  <para style="io">4. Loyalonjile kota Yesu ndo Mkulu kwa chila nzila, yandiche kangulavya malajizo menji galinguganigwa kukolelwa mijito kwa madito (Waebulaniya 10:32-13:17).</para>
  <para style="io">5. Mwiso yandiche kangugomanyiza baluwa kwa kuwakangaza nhumbula na kuwalamsa (Waebulaniya 13:18-25).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="HEB 1" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi kangulonga na wanhu kukolela Mwanage</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 1:1" />Aho katali, Nguluwi nakalonga na wasekulu wa hetwe mala nyinji kwa nzila zinjizinji na kwa kukolela waloli, <verse eid="HEB 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 1:2" />ila mazuwa gano ga kuduma, nakalonga na hetwe kwa kukolela Mwanage. Heye ndo yawele kwa kukolela Nguluwi nakalumba ulanga na isi na vinhu vyeng'ha vilimumo, nakamhagula na kuvidita vinhu vyeng'ha viwe vya heye. <verse eid="HEB 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 1:3" />Heye ndo lung'halo lwa ukulu wa Nguluwi, na kiwhana ng'hatu na vyoyali heye Nguluwi, yoiyegamiza isi kwa ulonzi wake luwele na ludali. Hanga loyasindile kuwahovuga wanhu wihe wa hewo, nakekala ako kuchanya kilanga, ubanzi wa kudilo wa Nguluwi Mkulu.<verse eid="HEB 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ukulu wa Mwana wa Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 1:4" />Mwana ndo mkulu kusinda mhilisi wa kilanga, kota vila itagwa loyapegwe na Nguluwi ndo likulu kusinda itagwa lyawo. <verse eid="HEB 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 1:5" />Nguluwi hamlonjele ne yumwe wa wala wahilisi wa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Hegwe ndo mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">heni lehano nandiwa Mhaza wa hegwe.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 1:5">Ne halonjile kuwala mhilisi yoneche,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">“Heni ndowa Mhaza wa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:5">naye kowa Mwana wa heni.”<verse eid="HEB 1:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 1:6" />Ila Nguluwi loyali yomlajiza Mwanage mlelwa wa mwaluko, kuli isi nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:6">“Wahilisi wa kilanga weng'ha wamfugamile.”<verse eid="HEB 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 1:7" />Ila kwa mbuli ya wahilisi wa kilanga, nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">“Nakawadita wahilisi wa heye wawe mbeho,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:7">na vitumagwa wa heye wawe milapi ja chiluli.”<verse eid="HEB 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 1:8" />Ila kwa Mwanage, Nguluwi nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:8">“Gwa Nguluwi, chigoda cha hegwe cha undewa ndo cha mazuwa gose! Hegwe kwanguwalongoza wanhu wa hegwe kwa hachi.<verse eid="HEB 1:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 1:9" />Hegwe kwangugana gatanganiche na kwanguzudila wihe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">kwa chiwalo acho, Nguluwi, Nguluwi wa hegwe,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">nakakuhagula kwa kukubakaliza mafuta ga usangalalo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:9">kusinda wayago.”<verse eid="HEB 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 1:10" />Nakalonga kahi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">“Hegwe Mkulu Nguluwi, nakuwika iganga lya msisi lya isi aho mwaluko,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:10">ulanga ndo mijito ja moko ga hegwe.<verse eid="HEB 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 1:11" />Avyo vyokwaga, ila hegwe kopona,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:11">vyolala kota ivalo.<verse eid="HEB 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 1:12" />Kozibinabina kota ikanzu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">navyo kota mivalo kovigalula,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">Ila hegwe ndo yuyula mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:12">na ukomu wa hegwe wahela kuduma.”<verse eid="HEB 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 1:13" />Nguluwi hamlonjele ne yumwe mhilisi wa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">“Wikalise ubanzi wa kudilo kwa heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 1:13">mbaka ndiwawiche hasi wang'honyo wa hegwe wawe chigoda cha kuwichila magulu kwa chiwalo cha hegwe?”<verse eid="HEB 1:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 1:14" />Lelo wahilisi wa kilanga ndo choni? Ila ndo muhe hela wawele vitumagwa wa Nguluwi na wala wawele ngulajizwa kuwatanza wala woubochela ulohozi.<verse eid="HEB 1:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="HEB 2" />
  <para style="s">Ulohozi ukulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 2:1" />Ahyo tulole goya ng'hatu geng'ha tugahuliche, leka tuleche kwajilila. <verse eid="HEB 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 2:2" />Usenga ula wowapegwe wasekulu wa hetwe kukolela wahilisi wa kilanga na ulajilwa kota ukomya, leka munhu yoneche nayali hambe yauwinze na nakugalamka nakatagusigwa kota vyoiganigwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 2:3" />Lelo, hetwe tosulupuka ndaze wone tubeza ulohozi ukulu kota uno? Mwaluko Mkulu yuye nakaudamla ulohozi awu, wala wamhuliche nawatulonjela kota wangukomya. <verse eid="HEB 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 2:4" />Nguluwi kahi nakonjeza kulajila kukomya ako kwa kudita chila mbuli ya vinduzanduza na chinhu cha kububuwaza na kumha wanhu ukulu wa Muhe Yelile kota vyoyogana yuye.<verse eid="HEB 2:4" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo yalingutulohola hetwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 2:5" />Nguluwi hawawichile wahilisi wa kilanga wailongoze isi inyale ilinguya, ila isi yila tulingusima mbuli zake. <verse eid="HEB 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 2:6" />Kahi kuli Maandiko Matakatifu honhu hanji hangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">“Munhu ndo choni, mbaka umjese ama</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:6">munhu ndo choni mbaka umlolele?<verse eid="HEB 2:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 2:7" />Nakumdita yawe mdodo kusinda wahilisi wa kilanga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:7">nakumvaliza itaji lya ukulu na kuhulichizwa,<verse eid="HEB 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 2:8" />Nakuwika chila chinhu hasi ha magulu ga heye.”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 2:8">Kwakuwika vinhu vyeng'ha hali ludali lwa heye, Nguluwi nahalechile chinhu choneche chileche kulongozwa na heye. Ila kwa sambi, hatulingona munhu yovilongoza vinhu vyeng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 2:9" />Ila twangumona Yesu, Nguluwi yamditile kwa mhela udo hela, yawe hasi kusinda wahilisi wa kilanga, leka kwa kunoga kwa Nguluwi koyatulajile hetwe, Yesu nakabagama kwa mbuli ya wanhu weng'ha. Kwa chiwalo cha magazo mbaka kubagama kwa heye, lelo twangumona kavichigwa chipembelo cha ukulu na kinamizilwa. <verse eid="HEB 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 2:10" />Yali inojile ng'hatu kwa Nguluwi, yalingulumba na kwimiza vinhu vyeng'ha, nakamdita Yesu yawe yogongomanya kukolela kugazigwa, leka yawegale wana wenji wehanze ukulu wa heye. Mina Yesu ndo yalinguwalohola wanhu. <verse eid="HEB 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 2:11" />Heye kanguweliza wanhu wihe wa hewo, hamwe na wala welizwe, weng'ha wanaye Mhaza yumwe. Ndo mina Yesu halingona soni kuwachema hewo, wang'holoze, <verse eid="HEB 2:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 2:12" />kota vyoyalingulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">“Gwa Nguluwi, ndowasimila wang'holozangu madito ga hegwe.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:12">Ndokutogola kuli nhing'hano ya hewo ndokwimba lutogo lwa hegwe.”<verse eid="HEB 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 2:13" />Kahi kangulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“Ndomuwichila Nguluwi lyondilingitumbila.”</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">Nakalutilila kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 2:13">“Heni nda hano hamwe na wanhu yamhele Nguluwi wawe wanangu.”<verse eid="HEB 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 2:14" />Lelo, kwa vila wana awo, ndo wanhu wawele na lukuli na danda, hiho du, kahi na heye Yesu nakoya yafandile kota hewo na kihanza hamwe. Nakadita ahyo leka kwa kubagama kwa heye, yalisumye Limazoga liwele na ludali lwa kubagama, <verse eid="HEB 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 2:15" />nakadita ago, leka yawachumulile wala wawele kwa chiwalo cha kudumba kubagama, wawa wapogozi kuli ukomu wa hewo weng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 2:16" />Mina ndo yanguzeleka kota heye hoyile kuwatanza wahilisi wa kilanga, ila nakoya kuwatanza lulelo lwa Abulahamu. <verse eid="HEB 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 2:17" />Ndo mina naimgana yawe kota wang'holoze heye kwa chila chinhu, leka yawe Mtambika Mkulu wa hewo yawele wa kitumbila na yawele na isungu kuli kumkolela mijito Nguluwi, leka gehile ga wanhu gosigwe. <verse eid="HEB 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 2:18" />Kwa vila Yesu nakemilila kugazigwa loyajezigwe, ahyo koweza kuwatanza kahi wala walingujezigwa.<verse eid="HEB 2:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="HEB 3" />
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo mkulu kusinda Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 3:1" />Wang'holozangu, mchemigwe na Nguluwi kilanga muwe wa heye, mijese ng'hatu kwa chiwalo cha Yesu Chitumagwa na Mtambika Mkulu wa makundo ga kulonga kwa mlomo wa hegwe. <verse eid="HEB 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 3:2" />Heye nayali wa kukundigwa kwa Nguluwi, nakamhagula kukola mijito ya heye kota vila Musa naloyali wa kukundigwa kukola mijito kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 3:3" />Ila Yesu kanguganigwa kutogoligwa ng'hatu kusinda Musa kota vila mzenga ng'handa kopegwa ukulu kusinda ayo ng'handa. <verse eid="HEB 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 3:4" />Chila ng'handa huzengagwa na munhu yumwe, ila Nguluwi ndo yalinguzenga vinhu vyeng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 3:5" />Musa nayali chitumagwa wa kukundigwa kuli mijito ajo jeng'ha ja ng'handa ya Nguluwi, nayali mlolezi wa geng'ha Nguluwi goyolonga aho hamba. <verse eid="HEB 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 3:6" />Ila Kilistu ndo wa kukundigwa kota Mwana yawele na ludali kuli ng'handa ya Nguluwi. Hetwe ndo ng'handa ya heye wone tulutilile kwima nzinzili kuli kikangaza nhumbula na tulutilile kidayila kuli kitumbila kotuwele nako.<verse eid="HEB 3:6" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa wanhu wohambe wakunde</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 3:7" />Lelo, kota vyoyalingulonga Muhe Yelile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:7">“Lehano, wone muhuliche lizi lya Nguluwi,<verse eid="HEB 3:7" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 3:8" />mleche kuzidita nhumbula za hemwe ziwe zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">kota vyomditile kuli kubelenhuka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:8">kuli lila zuwa lya kujezigwa kula kuchiwala.<verse eid="HEB 3:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 3:9" />Ako wasekulu wa hemwe lowanjezile na kupima majesa ga heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:9">hanga nawajona mijito ja heni, jong'holile kwa miyaka makumi gane!<verse eid="HEB 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 3:10" />Kwa mbuli ahyo nanzudizwa na hewo na kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">‘Mazuwa geng'ha wanhu wano nawajilila mnhumbula za hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:10">hawazizelele nzila za heni.’<verse eid="HEB 3:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 3:11" />Lelo nanzudila nandilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:11">‘Hawokwinjila hali honhu hangu ha kwesela!’ ”<verse eid="HEB 3:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 3:12" />Wang'holozangu, milolele, yaleche kuwabaho yoneche hali hemwe munhu yawele na nhumbula yihile, ilingibagula na Nguluwi yawele mkomu. <verse eid="HEB 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 3:13" />Ila vyomlutilila kuhulika ulonzi awo “Lehano” wangusomigwa kuli Maandiko Matakatifu, mwanguganigwa kikangaza nhumbula chila zuwa, leka munhu yoneche hali hemwe yaleche kuwa mjuvi kwa chiwalo cha kuhadigwa na kudita gehile. <verse eid="HEB 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 3:14" />Kwa vila hetwe tweng'ha hamwe twa wanhu wa Kilistu, wone tochibatilila goya mbaka kuduma, kwima nzinzili kotwalinako aho mwaluko.<verse eid="HEB 3:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 3:15" />Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga hino,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">“Wone muhuliche lizi lya Nguluwi lehano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">mleche kuzidita nhumbula za hemwe ziwe zigagadale,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 3:15">kota mhela ula lowambelenhuche Nguluwi.”<verse eid="HEB 3:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 3:16" />Ndo whaani wahuliche lizi ya Nguluwi na kumbelenhuka? Ndo wala weng'ha walongozigwe na Musa kulawila isi ya Misili. <verse eid="HEB 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 3:17" />Nguluwi nakawazudilila whaani kwa miyaka makumi gane? Nakawazudila wala waditile gehile, nawabagama kula kugunuche. <verse eid="HEB 3:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 3:18" />Kahi ndo whaani awo wawele Nguluwi nakelaha howokwinjila ng'oo honhu hangu ha kwesela? Yali yolonga kwa wala wamhinduche. <verse eid="HEB 3:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 3:19" />Lelo, twangona kota hawenjile ako kwa vila nahawakundile.<verse eid="HEB 3:19" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="HEB 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 4:1" />Lelo, kwa vila ing'hali baho yila mbuli ya kulagana yoyalonjile Nguluwi ya kwinjila hali honhu ha kwesela ha heye, tilolele leka yumwe hali hetwe yaleche kulemwela kwinjila mli lubehelo alo. <verse eid="HEB 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 4:2" />Mina Mbuli Inojile idamligwa kwa hetwe kota vila vyoidamligwe kwa hewo wanhu wa katali. Ila usenga awo hauwatanzile ne chinhu choneche, mina nawauhulika ila hawaubochele kwa makundo. <verse eid="HEB 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 4:3" />Lelo hetwe tulingukunda twangupegwa kwesela ako koyatulonjele Nguluwi. Kota vyoyalonjile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">“Nanzudila nandilaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:3">‘Hawokwinjila hali honhu hangu ha kwesela!’ ”</para>
  <para style="m" vid="HEB 4:3">Nguluwi nakalonga ago hanga mijito ja heye najali jimalile kulawila loyalumbile isi. <verse eid="HEB 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 4:4" />Mina Maandiko gangulonga honhu hanji, mbuli za zuwa lya saba, “Nguluwi nakesela zuwa lya saba, nakaleka mijito ja heye jeng'ha.” <verse eid="HEB 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 4:5" />Kahi Maandiko gangulonga, “Hawokwinjila hali honhu hangu ha kwesela.” <verse eid="HEB 4:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 4:6" />Lelo, ipona kwa wanhu wanji kwinjila honhu ha kwesela, ila wala wa mwaluko kuhulika Mbuli Inojile hawenjile kwa vila nawalema kuhulichiza. <verse eid="HEB 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 4:7" />Nguluwi nakawika zuwa linji ilinguchemigwa “Lehano,” nakalonga hamba kwa nzila ya Daudi ulonzi woumalile kulonjigwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">“Wone muhuliche lizi lya Nguluwi lehano,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 4:7">mleche kuzidita nhumbula za hemwe ziwe zigagadale.”<verse eid="HEB 4:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 4:8" />Wone Yoshuwa nayawe yawafichize wanhu awo honhu hala ha kwesela, Nguluwi hayalilonga hamba mbuli ya zuwa iyage. <verse eid="HEB 4:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 4:9" />Ahyo, lelo, kung'hali baho Zuwa ya Kwesela kwa wanhu wa Nguluwi, kota vila Nguluwi vyoyeselile kuli zuwa lya saba. <verse eid="HEB 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 4:10" />Mina, chila yokwinjila honhu ha kwesela ha Nguluwi, kokwesela kuli mijito ja heye kota vila Nguluwi vyoyalechile mijito ja heye na kwesela. <verse eid="HEB 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 4:11" />Lelo, twikangaze kwinjila kuli honhu aho ha kwesela, leka kuwe kuduhu ne yumwe hali hetwe yolema kuhulichiza kota hewo vyowaditile.<verse eid="HEB 4:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 4:12" />Usenga wa Nguluwi ukomu na una ludali, ndo unoleka kusinda ipanga liwele na kunoleche kwili. Lyangwinjila kota ipanga mbaka mgati hawele nhumbula na muhe vyangiting'hana, mbaka mgati mwa vitomo vya lukuli na mafuta gawele mgati mwa izeje. Ulonzi awo wangupembula kugana majesa ga nhumbula za wanhu. <verse eid="HEB 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 4:13" />Kuduhu chilumbigwe choneche chivisigwe hali Nguluwi, chila chinhu chigubuligwa hali meho gake heye hanga kwa heye toganigwa kulonga gala geng'ha gotuditile.<verse eid="HEB 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Yesu ndo Mtambika Mkulu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 4:14" />Kwa vila twanaye Mtambika Mkulu kusinda weng'ha yenjile mbaka kilanga, Yesu, Mwana wa Nguluwi, lelo tibatilile ng'hatu kukunda kotudamle kwa milomo ja hetwe. <verse eid="HEB 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 4:15" />Ayu Mtambika Mkulu wa hetwe yoweza kutonela isungu kwa ung'hochele wa hetwe, heye yuye nakajezigwa kwa chila mbuli kota hetwe ila haditile gehile. <verse eid="HEB 4:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 4:16" />Lelo, tuchihejelele ne kudumba chigoda cha undewa cha Nguluwi yawele yanojile, tubochele isungu lya heye na kunoga kwa Nguluwi, leka vitutanze kuli mhela hotugana.<verse eid="HEB 4:16" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 4" />
  <chapter number="5" style="c" sid="HEB 5" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 5:1" />Chila mtambika mkulu kanguhaguligwa na kuwichigwa na Nguluwi kulawa hali wanhu, heye kangukola mijito ja Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha wanhu, kulavya ndolendole na nhambiko kwa chiwalo cha gehile. <verse eid="HEB 5:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 5:2" />Hanga heye yuye ndo kang'hochele, koweza kuwaditila kwa isungu wala wanhu wajilile na walingudita nongwa, kwa vila hawavizelele. <verse eid="HEB 5:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 5:3" />Kwa mbuli ayo kanguganigwa kulavila nhambiko haiwele kwa mbuli ya wanhu hela, ila kahi kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga heye yuye. <verse eid="HEB 5:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 5:4" />Kuduhu munhu yoweza kiyinula yawe mtambika mkulu. Chila mtambika mkulu kahagulagwa na Nguluwi kota vyoiwele kwa Aluni.<verse eid="HEB 5:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 5:5" />Hihyo du naye Kilistu, heye hehagule yuye yawe mtambika mkulu, ila nakahaguligwa na Nguluwi na kumlonjela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">“Hegwe ndo Mwanangu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:5">heni lehano ndiwa mhaza wa hegwe.”<verse eid="HEB 5:5" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 5:6" />Nakamlonjela heye kahi honhu hanji, kuli Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">“Hegwe ndo mtambika mazuwa gose,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 5:6">kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melikisedeki.”<verse eid="HEB 5:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 5:7" />Yesu loyali yochikala hano muisi, nakamlanda Nguluwi kwa chililo na kulavya mahozi, yawele na ludali lwa kumlohola kuli kubagama, naye nakahulichizwa kwa vila nakamnojeza Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 5:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 5:8" />Hanga nayali Mwana wa Nguluwi, nakelangusa kumhulichiza Nguluwi kukolela kugazigwa. <verse eid="HEB 5:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 5:9" />Naloyasindile kukola mijito yoyapegwe na Nguluwi, ahyo ndo vyoyawalongoze wanhu weng'ha wamhulichize kuli ulohozi wa mazuwa gose, <verse eid="HEB 5:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 5:10" />naye Nguluwi nakalonga, weng'ha wavizele kota, heye ndo mtambika mkulu, kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melikisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 5:10" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makanyo kwa chiwalo cha kugalamka</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 5:11" />Twanago menji ga kulonga kwa chiwalo cha mbuli ino, ila haiwele mbuli ya ubewe kuwalonjela, kwa vila hemwe hamlinguvizela himahima. <verse eid="HEB 5:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 5:12" />Kwa mhela awu hemwe mwahaganigwe kuwa walangusa, ila mng'hali mwangugana munhu wa kuwalangusani ulanguso wa mwaluko kuli mbuli ya usenga wa Nguluwi. Mhiluka kuli kong'ha itombo honhu ha kulya chilyo chigagadale. <verse eid="HEB 5:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 5:13" />Chila munhu yoganigwa kong'ha itombo yang'hali mwana, havizelele kudita gala malanguso ga mbuli za kutanganika. <verse eid="HEB 5:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 5:14" />Ila chilyo chigagadale ndo kwa chiwalo cha wanhu wakangale, wala wavizelele kubagula ganojile na gehile, kwa chiwalo cha kugazela malanguso na madito ga kumnojeza Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 5:14" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 5" />
  <chapter number="6" style="c" sid="HEB 6" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 6:1" />Lelo, tugaleche kulangusa kahi gala malanguso ga mwaluko kwa chiwalo cha Kilistu, tuhejele kumwando kwa gala malanguso gakangale, haiwele kulutilila kuwika msisi kuli ulanguso wa kileka na madito hagalingutanza chinhu kuwala kumkunda Nguluwi, <verse eid="HEB 6:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 6:2" />malanguso kwa nzila nyinji za ubatizo na kuwichilwa moko na kuzilipuka kwa wabagame na utaguso wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="HEB 6:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 6:3" />Alyo tolidita, wone Nguluwi yakundize.<verse eid="HEB 6:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 6:4" />Mina kuwahilusa wanhu waleche gehile kahi, wanhu wawele wavizelele kukomya kwa Nguluwi na wajezile ndolendole za kilanga na welumbile hamwe kubochela Muhe Yelile <verse eid="HEB 6:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 6:5" />na kujeza ulonzi wa Nguluwi na mong'ho wa isi ilinguya, <verse eid="HEB 6:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 6:6" />hamba wamgalamchile Nguluwi kahi. Yowa nongwa kwa vila hewo kota wangumuwamba kahi mumsalaba Mwana wa Nguluwi lwa keli na kumbasa soni hazelu.<verse eid="HEB 6:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 6:7" />Misanga jiwele kutowelwa nhonya baho na koteza mizuchila jilingigala mbena kwa mlimi jitambichizwa na Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 6:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 6:8" />Ila wone misanga ajo jote migodi ja miwa na misolo, jahela utanzi, behi jopanjilwa na Nguluwi na ako mwiso ndo kusomigwa na chiluli.<verse eid="HEB 6:8" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 6:9" />Wang'holozangu hanga tulonjile ahyo, twima nzinzili kota mwa mnzila inojile iwele ndo nzila ilinguwalongoza kuli ulohozi. <verse eid="HEB 6:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 6:10" />Nguluwi halingudita mbuli zohaziganigwe, heye hoisemwa hebu mijito yomkolile na igano lyomlajile kwa itagwa lya heye kuli utanzi womuwapele wanhu wa heye walingumkunda Kilistu na womlingulutilila kumha. <verse eid="HEB 6:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 6:11" />Natwe twangugana ng'hatu chila yumwe wa hemwe yalajile kikangaza kukula mbaka kuduma, leka gala mlingitumbila genele. <verse eid="HEB 6:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 6:12" />Ahyo mleche kuwa wagata, ila muwe kota wala walingukunda na wali ngwimilila, wabochele gala gawele Nguluwi yalagane na hewo kowapa.<verse eid="HEB 6:12" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ilagano lya Nguluwi ndo lya kukomya</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 6:13" />Nguluwi loyamlonjele Abulahamu komha chila yalagane kumha, nakelaha kwa itagwa lyake heye, mina kuduhu yawele mkulu kusinda Nguluwi yawele kwa heye yahawezile kilaha. <verse eid="HEB 6:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 6:14" />Nguluwi nakalonga, “Ndangukomya ng'hatu, ndokutambichiza na ndokupa lulelo lwinji.” <verse eid="HEB 6:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 6:15" />Abulahamu nakabeteza kwa kwimilila ng'hatu ahyo nakabochela chila choyalagane Nguluwi komha. <verse eid="HEB 6:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 6:16" />Wanhu howochilaha, welahaga kwa yumwe yawele mkulu kusinda hewo, kilaha kwangulajila kukomya kwa chila chilonjigwe na kusa ibamba lyeng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 6:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 6:17" />Naye Nguluwi nakawika nzinzili chila choyalonjile kwa kilaha, ahyo nakawalajila hazelu kota wala wobochela chila choyalagane kwa kilaha. <verse eid="HEB 6:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 6:18" />Lelo, kuna vinhu vino vili, chila choyalonjile Nguluwi na kilaha, vyohaviwele galuka na kwa mbuli ya avyo Nguluwi howeza kulonga udesi. Ahyo hetwe twangubilimila kikala goya kwa heye, twangupegwa nhumbula ya kibatilila kitumbila kuwichigwe kumwando kwa hetwe. <verse eid="HEB 6:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 6:19" />Twanako kitumbila kuwele kota ngwamo ibatilile ukomu wa hetwe. Kitumbila ako kwangwinjila mbaka honhu helile ng'hatu. <verse eid="HEB 6:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 6:20" />Yesu yuye nakalongola kwinjila amo kwa mbuli ya hetwe na kawa mtambika mkulu mazuwa gose, kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melekisedeki.<verse eid="HEB 6:20" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 6" />
  <chapter number="7" style="c" sid="HEB 7" />
  <para style="s">Mtambika Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 7:1" />Melikisedeki nayali mndewa wa Salemu na mtambika wa Nguluwi. Abulahamu loyahiluche kulawa kuli ngondo koyawakopole wandewa, Melikisedeki nakaluta kiting'hana naye, naye Melikisedeki nakamtambichiza Abulahamu, <verse eid="HEB 7:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 7:2" />naye Abulahamu nakamha heye honhu hamwe ha kumi ha vinhu vyeng'ha vyoyabochile. Mana ya itagwa Melikisedeki ndo “Mndewa Yatanganiche.” Kahi kwa vila heye nayali “mndewa wa Salemu,” itagwa lyake lyanguzeleka ndo, “Mndewa wa kikala goya.” <verse eid="HEB 7:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 7:3" />Mhaza wa heye na mayake hawalinguzeleka ne lukolo lwake halulinguzeleka, hailinguzeleka nakavumbuka hanili ama nakabagama hanili. Kangiwhana na Mwana wa Nguluwi na kangulutilila kuwa mtambika mazuwa gose.<verse eid="HEB 7:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 7:4" />Lelo mwangona munhu ayu vyoyali mkulu. Mbaka Sekulu wa hetwe Abulahamu nakamha chilundo chimwe cha kumi ya vinhu vyeng'ha vyoyaholile kulawa kuli ngondo. <verse eid="HEB 7:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 7:5" />Tuvizela kahi kota mgati mwa malajizo yandichigwa, lulelo lwa Lawi wawele ndo watambika, wanguganigwa kuhola chilundo cha kumi kulawa kwa wanhu, wala wawele wang'holozawo, hanga na hewo ndo lulelo lwa Abulahamu. <verse eid="HEB 7:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 7:6" />Ila ayo Melikisedeki hawele wa lukolo lwa Lawi, ila heye nakabochela chilundo cha kumi kulawila kwa Abulahamu, kahi nakamtambichiza heye nayalagane na Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 7:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 7:7" />Kuduhu mbuli ne hado kota yalingumtambichiza ndo mkulu kusinda yula yalingutambichizwa. <verse eid="HEB 7:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 7:8" />Kahi, awo watambika walingubochela chilundo chimwe cha kumi, ndo wanhu wawele kubagama, ila ahano yalingubochela chilundo chimwe cha kumi, yani Melikisedeki, heye hambe yabagame. <verse eid="HEB 7:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 7:9" />Lawi ndo sekulu wa wala weng'ha wawele ngubochela chilundo chimwe cha kumi, Lawi naye nakalavya chilundo chimwe cha kumi kukolela Abulahamu, <verse eid="HEB 7:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 7:10" />kwa vila Lawi nayali hanapondigwa, mhela Melikisedeki loyating'hane na heye.<verse eid="HEB 7:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 7:11" />Kulawa kuli watambika wa Walawi, wanhu wa Isilaeli nawabochela malajizo. Lelo, wone wanhu nawahawele watanganiche kwa mijito ya Walawi, nakwahawele kahi na chiwalo cha kulawila utambika unji, kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melekisedeki na hauwele ula wa Aluni. <verse eid="HEB 7:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 7:12" />Mina utambika ula hougaluka, ndo na malajizo nago ganguganigwa gagaluche. <verse eid="HEB 7:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 7:13" />Naye Mkulu wa hetwe yawele mbuli azo zeng'ha zangulonjigwa kwa heye, nayali wa nhanzi yinji, kuduhu ne yumwe wa nhanzi ayo ya heye yawahiche kudita mijito kuli honhu ha kulavila nhambiko mhela loyawele mtambika. <verse eid="HEB 7:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 7:14" />Mina naizeleka kota heye Mkulu, nakalawila kuli nhanzi ya Yudasi, naiwele Musa nahalonjile ulonzi woneche wula kwa chiwalo cha watambika.<verse eid="HEB 7:14" /></para>
  <para style="s">Mtambika yunji yewhanile na Melikisedeki</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 7:15" />Kahi mbuli ayi yotulonjile yahazelu ng'hatu, kwa vila kalawila mtambika yunji yalingiwhana na Melikisedeki. <verse eid="HEB 7:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 7:16" />Heye hawele mtambika kwa malajizo ga chiwunhu kwa kulola kangulawila lukolo lwachi, ila kwa mong'ho wa ukomu wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="HEB 7:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 7:17" />Mina Maandiko gangulonga, “Hegwe ndo mtambika mazuwa gose, kwa kuwinza utambika wa Melikisedeki.” <verse eid="HEB 7:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 7:18" />Lelo, ula mzilo wa katali kwa chiwalo cha utambika nawali usigwe kwa vila nawali ng'hochele na hauwele wa kuhega. <verse eid="HEB 7:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 7:19" />Mina malajizo ga Musa hagaditile chinhu choneche chila chiwe goya. Ila sambi, honhu ha heye hawichigwa hawe ha kitumbila ng'hatu kwa chiwalo acho toweza kumhejelela Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 7:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 7:20" />Mzidi wa ago geng'ha, ahano Nguluwi nakelaha. Wanji nawali watambika ne kilaha. <verse eid="HEB 7:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 7:21" />Ila Yesu nakaditikwa mtambika kwa kilaha mhela Nguluwi loyamlonjele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">“Mkulu Nguluwi nakelaha,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">hogalula kunuwila kwa heye,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 7:21">‘Hegwe ndo mtambika mazuwa gose.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 7:21" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 7:22" />Lelo kwa chiwalo cha kilaha aku, Yesu kawa yumwe yaditile ilagano linojile ng'hatu.<verse eid="HEB 7:22" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 7:23" />Lelo nakwali na watambika wenji wali ahyo, kwa vila chila mhela wa heye kubagama loufichile nakabagama, ahyo nawalemwela kulutilila na mijito ja utambika. <verse eid="HEB 7:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 7:24" />Ila kwa vila Yesu ndo mkomu mazuwa gose, utambika wa heye hauduma hebu. <verse eid="HEB 7:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 7:25" />Ahyo, heye koweza ng'hatu kuwalohola weng'ha walingumlutila Nguluwi kukolela heye, mina heye ndo mkomu mazuwa gose kuwalandila kwa Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 7:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 7:26" />Kwa vila natuganigwa tuwe na Mtambika Mkulu yatanganiche kwa chiwalo cha hetwe na yawele yelile na nayawele hela nongwa na yalihela gehile mgati mwa heye na yeyusile kutali na wanhu wawele na gehile na yenuligwe kuchanya kilanga. <verse eid="HEB 7:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 7:27" />Heye nayali vinji na watambika wakulu wanji, heye nahaganile kulavya nhambiko chila zuwa, mwaluko kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga heye yuye, hamba kwa chiwalo cha gehile ga wanhu. Heye nakadita ahyo kamwe hela kwa chiwalo cha wanhu weng'ha, loyelavile nhambiko heye yuye. <verse eid="HEB 7:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 7:28" />Malajizo ganguwawika wanhu wawele ng'hochele kuli utambika ukulu, ila ilagano lya Nguluwi yaditile kwa kilaha liwele lyuyile honhu ha malajizo imhagula Mwana, yawele yatanganiche mazuwa gose.<verse eid="HEB 7:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 7" />
  <chapter number="8" style="c" sid="HEB 8" />
  <para style="s">Mtambika Mkulu wa Ilagano Linyale</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 8:1" />Lelo, mbuli itanganiche kuli aga tulingulonga ndo ali. Hetwe twanaye mtambika mkulu yawele yekalise ubanzi wa kudilo kuli chigoda cha Undewa cha Nguluwi wa kilanga. <verse eid="HEB 8:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 8:2" />Heye nakakola mijito ja mtambika mkulu honhu helile hawele hala mgati mwa lila ihema lya kukomya lizenjigwe na Mkulu, halizenjigwe na munhu.<verse eid="HEB 8:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 8:3" />Chila mtambika mkulu kahaguligwa kumlavila Nguluwi ndolendole na nhambiko. Vivyo du, mtambika mkulu wa hetwe kangulapigwa naye yawe na chinhu cha kulavya nhambiko. <verse eid="HEB 8:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 8:4" />Kota heye Kilistu na yawe wa hano muisi, hayali kuwa mtambika, kwa vila wabaho watambika wanji wangulavya nhambiko kota malajizo vyogalingugana. <verse eid="HEB 8:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 8:5" />Mijito ja hewo ja chiutambika ndo kiwhana hela na gala gawele kilanga. Mina Musa loyali behi kuligongomanya lila ihema, Nguluwi nakamlonjela, “Ugongomanye chila chinhu kwa kuwinza kula kiwhana ya lila ihema lyoulajilwe kula kuchidunda.” <verse eid="HEB 8:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 8:6" />Ila sambi Yesu kabochela mijito ja utambika jiwele jinojile kusinda ja hewo, kota vila uhanyisi woyawichile hagati ha wanhu na Nguluwi ndo kanoga ng'hatu, kwa vila lina kunoga kwake kuli ilagano lya mbuli zitanganiche ng'hatu.<verse eid="HEB 8:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 8:7" />Mina kota lila ilagano lya sambi naliwehela nongwa, hanakwalikuwa na mbuli ya ilagano lya keli. <verse eid="HEB 8:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 8:8" />Ila Nguluwi nakona wanhu wa heye wana nongwa, naye nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">“Mazuwa ganguya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:8">aho hondidita ilagano linyale, na wanhu wa Isilaeli na wanhu wa Yuda.<verse eid="HEB 8:8" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 8:9" />Ilagano ali haliwa kota lila lyondiliditile na wasekulu wa hewo</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">mazuwa gondiwalongoze kulawa isi ya Misili.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Hawawele wakitumbila kwa ilagano lya heni,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:9">Mkulu nakalonga, nani nandiwaleka.<verse eid="HEB 8:9" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 8:10" />Mkulu kangulonga, ali ndo ilagano lyondidita na wanhu wa Isilaeli,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">hogakwete mazuwa ago.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Ndowika malajizo gangu mluhala lwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">nakwandika mnhumbula za hewo.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">Heni ndowa Nguluwi wa hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:10">nawo wowa wanhu wa heni.<verse eid="HEB 8:10" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 8:11" />Kuduhu munhu yalingumlangusa yalingikalasa habehi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">wala yalingumlangusa mng'holeze,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">‘Umzele Mkulu.’</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:11">Mina weng'ha wadodo na wang'hangala wonzela heni.<verse eid="HEB 8:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 8:12" />Ndowalechela kwa gala waditile,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 8:12">ne sikumbuchila kahi wihe wa hewo.”<verse eid="HEB 8:12" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 8:13" />Kwa kulonga mbuli ya ilagano lya sambi, Nguluwi nakalidita lila lilongole lilale na cheng'ha chilingulala ng'hatu chahabehi kuka.<verse eid="HEB 8:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 8" />
  <chapter number="9" style="c" sid="HEB 9" />
  <para style="s">Kumfugamila Nguluwi kuli ihema lya kuli isi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 9:1" />Ilagano lya mwaluko nalyali na vihendo vyake vya kumkolela mijito Nguluwi, nahali na ihema lyelile lyakufugamila kuli isi. <verse eid="HEB 9:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 9:2" />Nahazenjigwa ihema hali chihengo cha mwaluko, nahachemigwa Honhu Helile. Amo namwali na honhu ha kuwichila chenje, chisaga na mibumunda jiwichigwe goya. <verse eid="HEB 9:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 9:3" />Kumbele kwa ipaziya lya keli, nahali na ihema nalichemigwa Honhu Helile ng'hatu. <verse eid="HEB 9:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 9:4" />Amo namwali na honhu ha kumfugamila Nguluwi ha zahabu kwa mbuli ya kufunyizila ubani na isanduku lya ilagano, lyali liwichigwe zahabu nzingo zeng'ha, mgati mwake mwali na chiya cha zahabu chiwele na chilyo chizeleche kota mana, ng'hweku ya Aluni iwele ibahule misolo na uluwa, navyo vibawo vili lya maganga vyandichigwe ilagano. <verse eid="HEB 9:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 9:5" />Mchanya mwa alyo isanduku nakwali na vilumbigwe vifandile kota wahilisi, vilingulajila kota hala honhu hana ukulu wa Nguluwi na mabawa gawo nagagonzoligwa kugubika chigubiko cha isanduku mchanya mwa honhu halingusigwa gehile. Ila sambi hatuweza kulonga kwa mgati ng'hatu kuli mbuli azo.<verse eid="HEB 9:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 9:6" />Vinhu avyo naviwichigwa goya na hamba iwa chihendo kwa watambika kwinjila chila zuwa kuli honhu ha mwaluko ha ihema lya kunze kudita mbuli za utambika. <verse eid="HEB 9:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 9:7" />Ila ndo mtambika mkulu yaliyeka ndo yalingwinjila kuli chila chihengo cha keli cha ihema, naye huditaga hiho mala imwe hela kwa mwaka, nakaganigwa kigala danda ya kumlavila Nguluwi kwa mbuli ya heye yuye na kwa mbuli ya gehile ga wanhu waditile ne kuvizela. <verse eid="HEB 9:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 9:8" />Kwa nzila ayi, Muhe Yelile kangulajila kota kwa vila lila ihema lya mwaluko nalyali ling'hali limile, nzila ya kwinjila Honhu Helile ng'hatu hainachumuligwa. <verse eid="HEB 9:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 9:9" />Nhelo ayi yangulajila mbuli vyoiwele mhela wa sambi, iwele ndolendole na nhambiko zangulavigwa kwa Nguluwi, ila haziweza kusa itunyo lya gehile kulawa kuli nhumbula za wanhu walingumfugamila Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 9:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 9:10" />Mbuli azi zeng'ha zangukoleka kwa chiwalo cha ndiya na vya kunwa na vihendo vinji vya mvina ya kihovuga. Mbuli azo zeng'ha haziwele za chimuhe, ludali lwake ludumaga mhela Nguluwi hoyodita goya vinhu vyeng'ha.<verse eid="HEB 9:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 9:11" />Ila Kilistu mina koya, yawele ndo mtambika mkulu wa mbuli zinojile, gawele gafichile sambi. Heye kenjila kuli ihema likulu ng'hatu liwele ligongomanyigwe ng'hatu, lyohaliditikwe na wanhu, nahaliwele honhu ha isi ino ilumbigwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 9:12" />Heye nakenjila Honhu Helile ng'hatu kamwe hela, haholile danda ya mhene na isenga ilogota, ila danda ya heye yuye, kukolela ayi, katugalila ugombozi wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="HEB 9:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 9:13" />Wanhu nawawele wavu kuli mbuli za kumfugamila Nguluwi nawaweza kuhovujigwa na kwela mlukuli mwao howamizilwe danda ya mhene na ya ibuguma hamwe na mivu ja isenga ilogota. <verse eid="HEB 9:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 9:14" />Ila, kwa danda ya Kilistu, mbuli ng'hulu ng'hatu ziditagwa! Kwa ludali lwa Muhe wa Nguluwi wa mazuwa gose, Kilistu nakelavya yuye nhambiko igongomanyigwe ng'hatu kwa Nguluwi. Danda ya heye yotudita tuwe twelile kwa gala madito galingigala kubagama, leka tumkolele mijito Nguluwi yawele mkomu.<verse eid="HEB 9:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 9:15" />Ahyo heye ndo mhanyisi wa ilagano lya sambi wawele wala wachemigwe na Nguluwi woweza kutambichizwa mazuwa gose Nguluwi navyoyawalonjele. Kubagama kwa heye kwanguwagombola wanhu kulawila kwa ula wihe wowaditile mhela wa lila ilagano lya mwaluko.<verse eid="HEB 9:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 9:16" />Ulonzi wa ilagano lyangudita mijito hela wone kubagama kwa awo yaulonjile awo uhalizi woneka ndo kukomya. <verse eid="HEB 9:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 9:17" />Uhalizi hauweza kuditikwa mbaka kulawile kubagama, kwa vila uhalizi wahela ludali wone yandiche yang'hali mkomu. <verse eid="HEB 9:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 9:18" />Ndo mina nalila ilagano lya mwaluko halyaluche kukola mijito ne danda kuwabaho. <verse eid="HEB 9:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 9:19" />Chinhu cha mwaluko, Musa nakawadamlila wanhu weng'ha mizilo jeng'ha kota vyoiwele kuli malajizo, hamba nakahola danda ya isenga ilogota hamwe na mazi na kwa nhagala za isopolo na mhamba ndung'hu yochimizila chila chitabu cha malajizo na wanhu weng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 9:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 9:20" />Musa nakalonga, “Ayi ndo danda ilingutawiza ilagano lilajizwe na Nguluwi mlihulichize.” <verse eid="HEB 9:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 9:21" />Vivyo du Musa nakalimizila danda lila ihema na vinhu vya mijito ja utambika kwa kumfugamila Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 9:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 9:22" />Ena, na kuli malajizo behi chila chinhu chohovugwa kwa kuboholigwa danda, ne kuwa hela danda, hogokusigwa gehile.<verse eid="HEB 9:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Nhambiko ya Kilistu yangusa wihe wa wanhu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 9:23" />Vinhu vino viwele ndo kiwhana hela na mbuli za kukomya za kilanga, vyanguganigwa kuhovujigwa kwa danda. Ila vinhu vya kilanga yangugana nhambiko iwele inojile ng'hatu. <verse eid="HEB 9:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 9:24" />Mina Kilistu nahenjile Honhu Helile hazenjigwe na wanhu, chiwele ndo kiwhana hela na chila chinhu chiwele kilanga. Heye nakenjila kilanga kuko du koyawele sambi, kangwima kumwando kwa Nguluwi kwa mbuli ya hetwe. <verse eid="HEB 9:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 9:25" />Mtambika mkulu wa Wayahudi kenjilaga Honhu Helile ng'hatu chila mhela yawele na danda ya igongolo, ila Kilistu henjile amo leka yelavye yaliyeng'ha mala nyinji. <verse eid="HEB 9:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 9:26" />Mina naiwe ahyo, Kilistu nayahaganigwe kugazigwa mala nyinji kulawila kulumbigwa kwa isi. Ila sambi kalawila kamwe hela kuli kuduma kwa mhela kulavya wihe kwa kilavya heye yuye nhambiko. <verse eid="HEB 9:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 9:27" />Lelo, kota vila chila munhu kobagama mala imwe hela, hamba kokwima kumwando hali utaguso wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="HEB 9:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 9:28" />hihyo du Kilistu naye nakelavya nhambiko mala imwe hela kwa mbuli ya kusa gehile ga wenji. Hoyohiluka lwa keli, haiwele kwa chiwalo cha kusa gehile, ila ndo kwa chiwalo cha kuwalohola wala walingumbeteza.<verse eid="HEB 9:28" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 9" />
  <chapter number="10" style="c" sid="HEB 10" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 10:1" />Kwa vila malajizo ndo isisila hela lya mbuli zinojile hozikuya na haiwele kota vyogalingoneka ikomya kwa zila mbuli zinji, nhambiko zizila za malajizo zilingulavigwa chila mwaka, hazihega ng'oo kuwadita wala walingumfugamila wawe wagongomanywe. <verse eid="HEB 10:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 10:2" />Kota awo wanhu walingumfugamila Nguluwi nawahovujigwe ng'hatu gehile ga hewo, nahawalingiwona kahi kota wana gehile na nhambiko azo zeng'ha zahadumile. <verse eid="HEB 10:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 10:3" />Ila nhambiko azo zangukoleka chila mwaka kuwakumbusa wanhu wavizele kota wana wihe. <verse eid="HEB 10:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 10:4" />Mina danda ya isenga ibuguma na mhene haiweza hebu kulavya gehile.<verse eid="HEB 10:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 10:5" />Ndo mina Kilistu loyoyile kuli isi, nakalonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">“Huganile nhambiko ne nhambiko za kulakazwa,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:5">ila nakumbichila goya lukuli. <verse eid="HEB 10:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 10:6" />Nhambiko za kulakazwa na nhambiko za kusa gehile hambe zikunojeze.<verse eid="HEB 10:6" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 10:7" />Aho nandonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">‘Ulole nambuya, kudita goulingugana hegwe, gwa Nguluwi,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:7">kota vyoyandichigwe kuli chitabu cha malajizo. Nagandichigwa kuwala heni.’ ”<verse eid="HEB 10:7" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 10:8" />Mwaluko nakalonga, “Hambe ugane ne kunojezwa na nhambiko na ndolendole na nhambiko za kulakaza na nhambiko za kusa gehile.” Nakalonga ahyo hanga nhambiko azi zeng'ha zilavyagwa kota vyogalingugana malajizo. <verse eid="HEB 10:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 10:9" />Hamba nakalonga, “Nda hano, Hegwe Nguluwi, nda goya kudita kota vyoulingugana.” Ahyo Nguluwi nakosa nhambiko za katali na honhu hake nakawika nhambiko inji imwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 10:10" />Kwa vila Yesu Kilistu nakadita kota navyoyaganile Nguluwi, hetwe twanguhovujigwa tuwe welile kwa kulawa mli gehile ga hetwe, kwa yila nhambiko ya lukuli lwa heye loyalavile kamwe hela, itosa.<verse eid="HEB 10:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 10:11" />Chila mtambika Myahudi nakaditaga mijito ja kumfugamila Nguluwi na kulavya nhambiko zizila mala nyinji, nhambiko haziweza ng'oo kusa gehile. <verse eid="HEB 10:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 10:12" />Ila Kilistu nakalavya nhambiko imwe kwa mbuli ya gehile, nhambiko iwele na ludali mazuwa gose, hamba nakekala ubanzi wa kudilo wa Nguluwi, <verse eid="HEB 10:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 10:13" />kulawila mhela awo, kangubeteza wang'honyo wa heye wawichigwe hasi ha magulu gake. <verse eid="HEB 10:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 10:14" />Lelo, kwa nhambiko ya heye imwe, nakawadita wawe wagongomanywe mazuwa gose wala walingusigwa gehile ga hewo.<verse eid="HEB 10:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 10:15" />Naye Muhe Yelile kangutawiza ulolezi wa heye. Kangwaluka nakulonga,<verse eid="HEB 10:15" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 10:16" />Kangulonga Mkulu, “Ali ndo ilagano londidita na hewo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">mazuwa galinguya, kalonga Mkulu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">Ndowika malajizo ga heni mnhumbula mwao,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:16">na kuzandika mluhala mwawo.”<verse eid="HEB 10:16" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 10:17" />Hamba nakonjezela kalonga, “Sikumbuchila kahi gehile ga hewo, wala wihe wowalingudita.”<verse eid="HEB 10:17" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 10:18" />Lelo, hogokusigwa gehile, hakuwa na chiwalo kahi cha kulavya nhambiko ya kusa gehile.<verse eid="HEB 10:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Tumhejelele Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 10:19" />Lelo, mng'holozangu, kwa danda ya Yesu twangupegwa nhumbula yohambe idumbe ya kwinjila Honhu Helile. <verse eid="HEB 10:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 10:20" />Heye katuchumulila nzila inyale, nzila ilingutulongoza kuli ukomu, kukolela lila igubiko, luwele ndo lukuli lwake yuye. <verse eid="HEB 10:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 10:21" />Lelo twanaye mtambika mkulu yatanganiche yawele na ludali kwa mbuli ya ng'handa ya Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 10:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 10:22" />Ahyo tumhejelele Nguluwi kwa nhumbula zelile na makundo ga kukomya, kwa nhumbula zelile kulawa kuli majesa gehile, kwa ng'huli zihovujigwe kwa mazi ganojile. <verse eid="HEB 10:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 10:23" />Tibatilile ng'hatu ne kutigasika kitumbila kwa hetwe kotulonjile kwa mlomo, mina Nguluwi yaditile ilagano lya heye ndo wakitumbila. <verse eid="HEB 10:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 10:24" />Twitanze kiditila kwa mbuli ya kiyonjezela kikangaza kwa kigana kuli kudita ganojile. <verse eid="HEB 10:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 10:25" />Tuleche kuleka yila mbuli ya kiting'hana hamwe, kota vila wanhu wanji vyowawele ting'hana, kwa vila yanguganigwa titanze, mina zuwa lila lya Mkulu yahabehi.<verse eid="HEB 10:25" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 10:26" />Mina, lotulutilila kudita gehile kwa kugana twetwe, hala hotuvizelele kukomya, kuduhu nhambiko ilinguweza kulavigwa kahi kwa chiwalo cha kusa gehile. <verse eid="HEB 10:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 10:27" />Lilingupona ndo kubeteza hela kwa kukakama utaguso wa Nguluwi na chiluli ching'ang'ale lochiwabagamiza weng'ha walingumlema Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 10:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 10:28" />Munhu yoneche yohambe yahulichize malajizo ga Musa, kobagama ne kumonela isungu kuwele na ulolezi wa wanhu weli ama wadatu. <verse eid="HEB 10:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 10:29" />Ndaze, munhu yula yalingumbeza Mwana wa Nguluwi na kuibeza danda ya ilagano lya Nguluwi imditile yawe yahovujigwe, munhu yalingumliga Muhe wa Nguluwi, ganguganigwa yapegwe utaguso ukulu ulindaze? <verse eid="HEB 10:29" /><verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 10:30" />Mina natumzela yula yalonjile, “Heni ndohilusa chibida, heni ndohilusa,” Naye ndo nayalonjile kahi, “Mkulu kowatagusa wanhu wa heye.” <verse eid="HEB 10:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 10:31" />Ndo mbuli ya kudumba ng'hatu wone Nguluwi yakuwiche mmoko na kutagusigwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 10:32" />Mkumbuchile logalawile mazuwa gala ga mwaluko lommwemweselwe lumuli lwa Nguluwi. Hanga zuwa zila namfichigwa na magazo menji, hemwe namwimilila. <verse eid="HEB 10:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 10:33" />Mhela unji namlijigwa na kubasigwa soni hazelu, kahi namwali hamwe na wala wagazigwe kota mwemwe. <verse eid="HEB 10:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 10:34" />Namilumba kuli kugazigwa kwa wawele mchinweng'ho na lombochigwe lufufu lwenu namwimilila kwa kusangalala, mina namvizela kota mwanawo lufufu lunojile ng'hatu na lwa kikala mazuwa gose. <verse eid="HEB 10:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 10:35" />Lelo, mleche kwajiliza kitumbila kwa hemwe, mina kokigalilani ndolendole ng'hulu. <verse eid="HEB 10:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 10:36" />Mwanguganigwa kuwa na wimililo leka mweneze ligano lya Nguluwi na kubochela chila choyalagane kudita. <verse eid="HEB 10:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 10:37" />Mina kota vyogalingulonga Maandiko Matakatifu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">“Ing'hali hado hela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">na yula yalinguya, kokuya,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:37">ne hokawa hebu.<verse eid="HEB 10:37" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 10:38" />Ila munhu yalingudita ganojile kochikala kwa makundo,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">ila loyohiluka kumbele,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 10:38">heni sinojezwa naye.”<verse eid="HEB 10:38" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 10:39" />Lelo, hetwe hatuwele hamwe na wala walinguhiluka kumbele na kwajilila, ila hetwe twahamwe na wala walingukunda na kuloholigwa.<verse eid="HEB 10:39" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 10" />
  <chapter number="11" style="c" sid="HEB 11" />
  <para style="s">Makundo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 11:1" />Kuwa na makundo ndo kuwa na kukomya kwa mbuli zotulingitumbila, kutawiza ng'hatu mbuli zila zohatuziwene. <verse eid="HEB 11:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 11:2" />Mina wasekulu wa katali nawatogoligwa na Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha makundo ga hewo.<verse eid="HEB 11:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 11:3" />Kwa makundo hetwe tuvizela kota isi yeng'ha nailumbigwa kwa ulonzi wa Nguluwi, vinhu vilingoneka kulawa kuli vinhu havilingoneka.<verse eid="HEB 11:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 11:4" />Kwa makundo Abeli nakamlavila Nguluwi nhambiko inojile ng'hatu kusinda ila ya Kaini. Kwa makundo ga heye nakatawizwa na Nguluwi yawe yodita galingumnojeza Nguluwi. Nguluwi yuye nakanojezwa na nhambiko za heye. Kwa makundo ga heye hanga nakabagama, yang'hali yotulonjela.<verse eid="HEB 11:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 11:5" />Kwa makundo Henoki nakaholigwa na Nguluwi, yaleche kubagama. Honeche kahi kwa vila Nguluwi nakamhola. Maandiko Matakatifu gangulonga loyali hanaholigwa, heye nakamnojeza Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 11:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 11:6" />Lelo, wone kwahela makundo yowa nongwa kwa munhu kumnojeza Nguluwi. Kwa vila chila munhu yalingumlutila Nguluwi imgana yakunde kota Nguluwi kabaho na kuwapa chonolo wala walingumpala.<verse eid="HEB 11:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 11:7" />Kwa makundo Nuhu nakakanyigwa na Nguluwi kwa mbuli za hamba zohambe zoneche. Nakamhulichiza Nguluwi, nakazenga ila safina moyaloholigwe heye hamwe na ivyazi lyake. Kulawila kwa ago, isi yeng'ha naitagusigwa kwa wihe, naye Nuhu nakatanganika kwa makundo.<verse eid="HEB 11:7" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo ga Abulahamu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 11:8" />Kwa makundo Abulahamu nakamhulichiza Nguluwi loyachemigwe yalute kuli isi iwele Nguluwi yalonjile kompa iwe ya heye. Abulahamu nakaluta, hanga nahavizelele koyali yoluta. <verse eid="HEB 11:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 11:9" />Kwa makundo nakekala kota mjenzi kuli isi yalagane na Nguluwi. Nakekala ako kuli ihema kota vyowekale Isaka na Yakubu. Nawo kahi nawelumba kuli kilagana kukula. <verse eid="HEB 11:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 11:10" />Mina Abulahamu nayali yobeteza muji uwele na msisi wimile nzinzili mazuwa gose, muji uwele Nguluwi yuye ndo muwanzi na ndo yuye nayauzenjile. <verse eid="HEB 11:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 11:11" />Kwa makundo naye Sala nayawele mhende nakakunda kota Nguluwi kana mong'ho wa kudita gala yalagane, ahyo, nakaweza na himila hanga nayali yalalile. <verse eid="HEB 11:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 11:12" />Ahyo, kulawila kuli munhu ayo yumwe, Abulahamu, yawele kota vila munhu yabagame, nawalawila wanhu wenji hawawazigwe kota vila nhondwe za kilanga na kota vila sangalaza za mwhani.<verse eid="HEB 11:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 11:13" />Wanhu weng'ha awa nawabagama wawele na makundo. Nawabagama wang'hali bochela mbuli ziwele Nguluwi zoyali yalagane nawo, ila kwa kutali nawagona, wasechelela, na kulonga hazelu kota hewo nawali wajenzi na nawali mmajendo kuli isi. <verse eid="HEB 11:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 11:14" />Wanhu walingulonga mbuli kota azo, wangulajila ng'hatu kota wanguipala isi ya hewo. <verse eid="HEB 11:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 11:15" />Wone nawawe woijesa isi yowalawile katali, hawaliweza kuhiluka ako konawakulechile. <verse eid="HEB 11:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 11:16" />Ila sambi wangugana isi inojile ng'hatu, ndo iwele isi ya kilanga. Ndo mina Nguluwi halingona soni howomchema heye Nguluwi wa hewo, kwa vila heye yuye mina kasinda kuwagongomanyila muji.<verse eid="HEB 11:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 11:17" />Kwa makundo Abulahamu nakamlavya nhambiko mwanage Isaka mhela Nguluwi hoyamjezile. Ayo Abulahamu yuye du, hanga nakabochela chila choyalagane na Nguluwi, ila nakakunda kumlavya mwanage wa udewele yawe nhambiko, <verse eid="HEB 11:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 11:18" />hanga Nguluwi nayali yamlonjele, “Lulelo lwako lolawila kwa Isaka.” <verse eid="HEB 11:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 11:19" />Abulahamu nakakunda kuta Nguluwi koweza kuwazilipula wabagame na kwa nzila yinji, Abulahamu nakampata kahi Isaka kulawa kwa wabagame.<verse eid="HEB 11:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 11:20" />Kwa makundo Isaka nakawatambichiza Yakubu na Esau kuli ukomu wa hewo wa hamba.<verse eid="HEB 11:20" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 11:21" />Kwa makundo Yakubu loyali habehi kubagama, nakawatambichiza chila yumwe wa wana wa Yusufu, aku yomfugamila Nguluwi yawele yegamile yila ng'hweku ya heye.<verse eid="HEB 11:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 11:22" />Kwa makundo Yusufu loyali habehi kubagama, nakalonga mbuli ya kulawa kwa Waisilaeli kuli isi ya Misili, kahi nakawalechela ilajizo lya mbuli ya chowalinguganigwa kudita kwa chiwalo cha mizeje ja heye.<verse eid="HEB 11:22" /></para>
  <para style="s">Makundo ga Musa</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 11:23" />Kwa makundo wahaza wa Musa nawamvisa ayo mwana kwa miyezi jidatu loyapondigwe. Kwa vila nawamona kota ka mwana yanojile ng'hatu, ne hawadumbile mizilo ja mndewa.<verse eid="HEB 11:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 11:24" />Kwa makundo Musa loyawele munhu mkulu, nakalema kuchemigwa mwana wa mhinza wa Falao. <verse eid="HEB 11:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 11:25" />Nakona inoga kugazika hamwe na wanhu wa Nguluwi kusinda kusangalala kwa kudita gehile kwa mhela uchefu. <verse eid="HEB 11:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 11:26" />Nakavizela kota kugazika kwa mbuli ya Kilistu kunoga ng'hatu kusinda lufufu lweng'ha lwa isi ya Misili, mina nayali yololela chonolo cha hamba.<verse eid="HEB 11:26" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 11:27" />Kwa makundo Musa nakoka kulawa isi ya Misili ne kudumba ng'halazi ya Mndewa. Hahiluche kumbele, kota vila munhu yamuwene yula Nguluwi yohambe yoneche. <verse eid="HEB 11:27" /><verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 11:28" />Kwa makundo nakaidita mvina ya Pasaka na kumizila ndanda mchanya mwa lwizi, leka yula mhilisi yalingukopola yaleche kuwakopola walelwa wa mwaluko wa Isilaeli.<verse eid="HEB 11:28" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 11:29" />Kwa makundo wanhu wa Isilaeli nawaloka bahali ya Shamu kwa vila nayali isi ng'havu, ila Wamisili lowajezile kudita ahyo nawabagama mmazi.<verse eid="HEB 11:29" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="30" style="v" sid="HEB 11:30" />Kwa makundo kanzi za muji wa Yeliko nazigwa wanhu wa Isilaeli lowazungulute ng'hanzi azo kwa mazuwa saba. <verse eid="HEB 11:30" /><verse number="31" style="v" sid="HEB 11:31" />Kwa makundo Lahabu yawele mng'hondwa habagame hamwe na wala wamlemile Nguluwi, kwa vila nakawabochela wala wapugajizi.<verse eid="HEB 11:31" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="32" style="v" sid="HEB 11:32" />Lelo, ndonje choni ng'hatu? Mhela haulinguhega hebu kulonga mbuli ya Gidioni na Balaki na Samsoni na Yefuta na Daudi na Samweli na waloli wa Nguluwi. <verse eid="HEB 11:32" /><verse number="33" style="v" sid="HEB 11:33" />Kwa makundo awa weng'ha nawetowa ngondo na wandewa, nawawasumya. Nawalongoza kwa nzila iwaditile wanhu wadite ganojile, nawabochela gala Nguluwi yalagane na hewo. Nawajidinya milomo ja misimba, <verse eid="HEB 11:33" /><verse number="34" style="v" sid="HEB 11:34" />nawazimya chiluli ching'ang'ale, nawalohoka kubagama kwa ipanga, nawali ng'hochele ila nawapegwa mong'ho. Nahawawele wodumba kuli ngondo, nawawabilimisa wamizi wawele wajenzi. <verse eid="HEB 11:34" /><verse number="35" style="v" sid="HEB 11:35" />Wadala nawahilulilwa wanhu wa hewo wabagame wawele wazilipuligwe. Ila wamwe wa hewo nawagazigwa, nawalema kuchumulilwa, leka wazilipuligwe nakwinjila kuli ukomu unojile ng'hatu. <verse eid="HEB 11:35" /><verse number="36" style="v" sid="HEB 11:36" />Wanji nawabezigwa na kutowigwa ng'hobwa na wanji nawawohigwa minyololo na kutozigwa mchinweng'ho. <verse eid="HEB 11:36" /><verse number="37" style="v" sid="HEB 11:37" />Nawatowigwa na maganga mbaka kubagama, nawatemigwa kwa msumeno vihandevihande, nawakopoligwa kwa ipanga. Nawazunguluta wawele wavalile igozi lya ming'holo na igozi lya mhene, nawali wanhu wazunwa, wagazigwe na kuditilwa mbuli zihile. <verse eid="HEB 11:37" /><verse number="38" style="v" sid="HEB 11:38" />Isi nahaiganigwe iwe na wanhu awo. Nawali wojendajenda kugunuche na kuvidunda, wochikala kuli mipalika na mmikulubila.<verse eid="HEB 11:38" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="39" style="v" sid="HEB 11:39" />Wanhu awa weng'ha nawatogoligwa na Nguluwi kwa chiwalo cha makundo ga hewo. Ila, hawabochele mbuli ziwele Nguluwi nakalagana na hewo. <verse eid="HEB 11:39" /><verse number="40" style="v" sid="HEB 11:40" />Mina Nguluwi nayali yalongole kutuwichila goya vinhu vinojile ng'hatu kwa hetwe, leka hewo wafichile kuli kugongomanya hamwe na hetwe.<verse eid="HEB 11:40" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 11" />
  <chapter number="12" style="c" sid="HEB 12" />
  <para style="s">Nguluwi Mhaza wa hetwe</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 12:1" />Hetwe twanacho chilundo chikulu cha walolezi kumwando kwa hete. Lelo tuse chila chinhu chiwele ngutulemeza na gehile gala gatunanahile. Tubilime kwa kwimilila kuli kubilima kuwichigwe kumwando kwa hetwe. <verse eid="HEB 12:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 12:2" />Tumuwinze Yesu yawele ndo yaluchize makundo ga hetwe na ndo heye yogomanjiza. Kwa chiwalo cha kusangalala kuwele kuwichigwe kumwando kwa heye, heye nakemilila kubagama kuli msalaba, ne kudumba soni ya heye, lelo kangikala kuli ubanzi wa kudilo kwa chigoda cha undewa wa Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 12:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 12:3" />Mijese kuwala mbuli zimfichile Yesu, vyoyemilile kulemigwa kukulu na wanhu wawele na gehile. Lelo, mleche kugozola ne kutweguka nhumbula. <verse eid="HEB 12:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 12:4" />Kwavila ngondo yomlingitowa kwa chiwalo cha kusumya gehile, hamitowile mbaka mbohole danda. <verse eid="HEB 12:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 12:5" />Ndaze, msemwa wula ulonzi wa kuwakangaza, Nguluwi yawachemile hemwe kota wana wa heye?</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">“Mwanangu, uleche kubeza makanyo ga Mkulu,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:5">ne uleche kugozola hoyokung'hanuchila.<verse eid="HEB 12:5" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 12:6" />Mina Mkulu kawakanyaga wala yalinguwagana,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 12:6">heye komzapa chila mwana yalingukunda.”<verse eid="HEB 12:6" /></para>
  <para style="m">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 12:7" />Mwimilile kugazigwa kwa vila ndo ulanguso, Nguluwi huwaditilaga hemwe kota wanage. Mina ndo mwana wachi hambe yang'anuchilwe na kuzapigwa na mhaza wa heye? <verse eid="HEB 12:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 12:8" />Ila wone homzapigwa kota wana wanji, lelo, hemwe hamuwele wana wa heye, ila ndo wana chilokote. <verse eid="HEB 12:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 12:9" />Mzidi wa ago, hetwe twanguwahulichiza wahaza wa hetwe watupondile hala howotuzapa. Lelo, twanguganigwa kumhulichiza ng'hatu Mhaza wa hetwe wa chimuhe leka tulutilile kuwa wakomu. <verse eid="HEB 12:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 12:10" />Wahaza wa hetwe hano muisi nawatuzapa kwa mhela uchefu hela, kota hewo vyowawene inoga, ila Nguluwi kangutukanya kwa chiwalo cha kututanza twetwe baha, leka tuwe welile hali heye. <verse eid="HEB 12:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 12:11" />Kuzapigwa haiwele mbuli inojile ila ya kigala masinzo. Ila wala walanguswe kuwahulichiza, hamba wobeta chonolo cha kikala goya kuli ukomu ulingumnojeza Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 12:11" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malanguso na makanyo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 12:12" />Lelo, mkangaze moko ga hemwe galing'hochele na kukangaza mafugamilo ga hemwe gawele ng'hochele. <verse eid="HEB 12:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 12:13" />Mlutilile kudita ganojile, leka gala magulu gawele gaziliche galeche kulumizwa, ila yawe mkomu.<verse eid="HEB 12:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 12:14" />Mikangaze kikala goya na wanhu weng'ha. Mikale mwelile, kwa vila kuduhu munhu yomona Mkulu ne kuwa na ukomu kota awo. <verse eid="HEB 12:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 12:15" />Mikangaze ng'hatu munhu yoneche yaleche kwajiliza isungu lya Nguluwi. Milolele leka mizabi jiliusungu jileche kuzuka hali hemwe na kuwakopola wanhu wenji kwa dunga ya heye. <verse eid="HEB 12:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 12:16" />Milolele leka homuli haleche kuwa na munhu mng'hondwa ama munhu yohamzelele Nguluwi kota Esau, yawele yaguzile uhalizi wa heye wa mlelwa wa mwaluko kwa chilyo chido hela. <verse eid="HEB 12:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 12:17" />Hemwe mvizela kota nahala hoyaganile kuhola kahi ula utambichizo uwele wa heye, nakalemelwa, hanga nakapala kwa kulila.<verse eid="HEB 12:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 12:18" />Hemwe hamfichile kuli chidunda cha Sinai, uwele kibatika kota vyowaditile wanhu wa Isilaeli, hamfichile kuli chiluli chilingwaka, hawele na jiza na chimbunga, <verse eid="HEB 12:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 12:19" />kuwele na lizi ya mhalamhanda na lizi ya ulonzi. Wala wanhu wa Isilaeli nawahulika lizi alyo nawalanda waleche kuhulika kahi lizi linji, <verse eid="HEB 12:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 12:20" />ahyo hawawezile kwimilila ilajizo lilavigwe, “Yoneche yodoliza chidunda achi na yawe munhu ama igongolo, kotowigwa maganga.” <verse eid="HEB 12:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 12:21" />Ago geng'ha gangoneka nagali gakudumbiza ng'hatu, mbaka Musa nakalonga, “Ndangudumba na kukakama.”<verse eid="HEB 12:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 12:22" />Ila hemwe mfika kuli chidunda cha Siyoni, kuli muji wa Nguluwi yawele mkomu. Mfika Yelusalemu, muji wa kilanga, kuwele wating'hane wahilisi wa kilanga wenji kwa maelufu menji wasangalale. <verse eid="HEB 12:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 12:23" />Mfika kuli nhing'hano ng'hulu ya walelwa wa mwaluko wa Nguluwi, wawele matagwa gawo gandichigwa kilanga. Mwangwima kumwando kwa Nguluwi yawele mtagusa wa weng'ha na hawele na muhe wa wanhu walingudita ganojile. <verse eid="HEB 12:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 12:24" />Mfika kwa Yesu yawele mhanyisi kuli ilagano lya sambi na danda ya heye ibohoche yangulonga mbuli zinojile kusinda yila ya Abeli.<verse eid="HEB 12:24" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 12:25" />Lelo, milolele mleche kulema kumuhulichiza ayo yalingulonga na hemwe. Kota wala walemile kumhulichiza yula yawakanyile hano mu isi hawowa wakomu, hetwe tohega ndaze kuwa wakomu wone tulingulema kumhulichiza yula yalingutukanya kulawila kilanga? <verse eid="HEB 12:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="HEB 12:26" />Mhela wula lizi lyake nalitigasa isi, ila sambi nakalagana kahi, “Ndotigasa isi kahi, ila haiwele isi hela, ila na ulanga.” <verse eid="HEB 12:26" /><verse number="27" style="v" sid="HEB 12:27" />Ulonzi awu, “Kahi” wangutulajila kota vinhu vyeng'ha vya katali vilumbigwe vyotigaswa na vyokusigwa ila vila vinhu vinyale vyopona hovitigaswa hebu.<verse eid="HEB 12:27" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="28" style="v" sid="HEB 12:28" />Hetwe lelo, tulonje malumbo, kwa vila twangubochela undewa wohautigasika. Tumtogole na kumfugamila Nguluwi kuli kumnojeza na kumhulichiza ng'hatu, <verse eid="HEB 12:28" /><verse number="29" style="v" sid="HEB 12:29" />mina Nguluwi wa hetwe ndo chiluli chilingwaka ng'hatu na chilingulakaza.<verse eid="HEB 12:29" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 12" />
  <chapter number="13" style="c" sid="HEB 13" />
  <para style="s">Mbuli ya kumnojeza Nguluwi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="HEB 13:1" />Mlutilile kigana chilukolo. <verse eid="HEB 13:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="HEB 13:2" />Mleche kusemwa kuwabochela wajenzi, mina kwa kudita ahyo wanhu wanji nawawabochela wahilisi wa kilanga ne kuvizela. <verse eid="HEB 13:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="HEB 13:3" />Muwakumbuche wala wawele mchinweng'ho ifande kota hemwe namwe mwamchinweng'ho hamwe na hewo. Kahi muwakumbuche wala walikugazigwa ifande kota vila hemwe ndo mwangugazigwa kota hewo.<verse eid="HEB 13:3" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="HEB 13:4" />Wanhu wone wehese wangulapigwa wanhu weng'ha wawatogole, mlume na mdala waleche kujenda na wanhu wanji. Nguluwi kowatagusa wang'hondwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="HEB 13:5" />Mleche kuwa wanhu walingugana sendi ng'hatu, mkunde na vila vinhu vyomlinavyo. Heye Nguluwi nakalonga, “Sikuleka ng'o, ne sikutaga.” <verse eid="HEB 13:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="HEB 13:6" />Ndo mina twanguweza kulonga,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">“Mkulu ndo yalingunhanza,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">silingudumba chinhu.</para>
  <para style="q" vid="HEB 13:6">Munhu kondita choni?”<verse eid="HEB 13:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="HEB 13:7" />Muwakumbuche vilongozi wa hemwe wawele nawadamla usenga wa Nguluwi. Mlole goya vila navyowekale mbaka kubagama. Muwinze makundo ga hewo. <verse eid="HEB 13:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="HEB 13:8" />Yesu Kilistu ndo yuyula wa mazuwa gose. <verse eid="HEB 13:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="HEB 13:9" />Mleche kuhadigwa na malanguso ganji ga chijenzi. Kunoga kwa Nguluwi ndo kulingwimiza nhumbula za hetwe ne haiwele mizilo kwa mbuli ya chilyo, mizilo ajo hajimtanzile ne munhu yoneche.<verse eid="HEB 13:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="HEB 13:10" />Hetwe tuna honhu ha kulavila nhambiko hawele wala wang'hali wodita mijito mgati mwa ihema lya Wayahudi wahela ludali lwa kulya vinhu vya heye. <verse eid="HEB 13:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="HEB 13:11" />Mtambika mkulu wa Chiyahudi kegalaga danda ya migongolo kuli Honhu Helile ng'hatu na kuilavya nhambiko kwa mbuli ya gehile, ila lukuli lwa ajo migongolo ulakazwa kunze kwa kambi. <verse eid="HEB 13:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="HEB 13:12" />Vivyo du, Yesu naye nakagazigwa mbaka nakabagama kunze kwa lwizi lwa muji leka yawelize wanhu kwa danda ya heye. <verse eid="HEB 13:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="HEB 13:13" />Lelo, tuleche kudumba, tulute ako kunze kwa kambi, tukalemigwe kota vyoyalemigwe heye. <verse eid="HEB 13:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="HEB 13:14" />Mina hano mu isi twahela muji wa kikala mazuwa gose, ila twanguulolela muji ula ulinguya. <verse eid="HEB 13:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="HEB 13:15" />Lelo, kwa kukolela Yesu, mazuwa gose tumlavile Nguluwi nhambiko ya kitogola, mina ayo nhambiko ndo ulonzi wa hetwe hotulonga kwa itagwa lya Yesu ndo Mkulu. <verse eid="HEB 13:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="HEB 13:16" />Mleche kusemwa kudita ganojile na kitanza, mina azi ndo nhambiko zilingumnojeza Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 13:16" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="17" style="v" sid="HEB 13:17" />Minamize kwa vilongozi wa hemwe na kunyenyetela kwa hewo. Kwa vila hewo wanguzilolela nhumbula za hemwe nemisi na nechilo, na woganigwa kumlonjela Nguluwi mbuli ya mijito ya hewo jowaditile. Wone minamize kwa hewo wodita mijito ja hewo kwa kusechelela, waleche kona kota itunyo, wone wozidita kwa masinzo, mina ayo haiwatanza hemwe.<verse eid="HEB 13:17" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="18" style="v" sid="HEB 13:18" />Mtulandile na hetwe. Tuvizela ng'hatu kota nhumbula za hetwe hazilingutulonjela kota twanawo wihe, kwa vila twangugana kuwa na madito ganojile kuli mbuli zeng'ha. <verse eid="HEB 13:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="HEB 13:19" />Ndanguwadedeza ng'hatu mndandile kwa Nguluwi leka yanyiluse kwa hemwe himahima vyoilinguganigwa.<verse eid="HEB 13:19" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kulanda kwa chiwalo cha utambichizo</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="HEB 13:20" />Nguluwi nakamzilipula kuli kubagama Mkulu wa hetwe Yesu Kilistu kwa chiwalo cha danda ya heye, ilajile kukomya na kunojeza kwa ilagano lya mazuwa gose, yawele ndo mdimi mkulu wa ming'holo. <verse eid="HEB 13:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="HEB 13:21" />Ndangulanda heye yawegalile hemwe na chila madito ganojile leka mdite kota vyoyalingugana. Kahi kwa kukolela Yesu Kilistu, Kilistu yadite mgati mwa hemwe gala galingumnojeza heye. Ukulu uwe kwa heye, mazuwa gose! Ena.<verse eid="HEB 13:21" /></para>
  <para style="s">Ulonzi wa kugwisa chilasi</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="HEB 13:22" />Lelo wang'holozangu, ndanguwadedeza mbochele usenga awu wa kuwakangaza nhumbula. Ali ndo lyandiko lido hela liwele nandiwandichila. <verse eid="HEB 13:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="HEB 13:23" />Ndangugana kuwalonjelani kota mng'holozetu Timoteyi mina kachumulilwa mchinweng'ho. Wone yawahiche kufika hano, ndokuya naye hondikuya kwa hemwe.<verse eid="HEB 13:23" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="24" style="v" sid="HEB 13:24" />Muwalamse vilongozi wa hemwe weng'ha welile hamwe na wanhu wa Nguluwi! Wang'holozetu wawele Italiya wanguwalamsani. <verse eid="HEB 13:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="HEB 13:25" />Twanguwalandilani mweng'ha isungu lya Nguluwi.<verse eid="HEB 13:25" /></para>
  <chapter eid="HEB 13" />
</usx>